  "contract": "Mercenary for Hire! and High-Risk are open-world states, and the Wintergrasp battle is a team fight. A Human High-Risk Mercenary in Wintergrasp who accepts the battle's invitation keeps Mercenary for Hire! but it has no effect, and High-Risk turns itself off and is remembered: a High-Risk player nearby receives a player faction (Human or the Horde side's Orc) instead of the Outlaw faction 1163. A second such Mercenary who leaves the zone for Dalaran mid-battle gets High-Risk back and is an Outlaw again. When the battle ends, High-Risk returns and the Mercenary is an Outlaw again.",
